Now extend `preparePendingBackgroundAdvisories`, `releasePreparedBackgroundAdvisories`, `acknowledgeObservedBackgroundAdvisories` to also drain closeoutAdvisories. This requires modifying the loops. The current prepare loop:

```
for (const current of records) {
  if (prepared.length >= 1) break;
  const advisory = current.advisoryInbox;
  if (!advisory || ...parent mismatch || state !== 'pending') continue;
  if (preparation held by other prep & lease valid) continue;
  ... write back advisoryInbox with preparation
}
```

Extend: candidates = [advisoryInbox?] + closeoutAdvisories. For each record, iterate candidate entries; first eligible one gets prepared and written back to its slot. Let me rewrite that inner loop.

